{
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "book_title_announcement",
          "text": "Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, by Lewis Carroll.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 1,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "chapter_announcement",
          "text": "Chapter One. Down the Rabbit-Hole.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 2,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Alice was beginning to get very tired of sitting by her sister on the bank, and of having nothing to do.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 3,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "There was nothing so very remarkable in that; nor did Alice think it so very much out of the way to hear the Rabbit say to itself.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 4,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Oh dear! Oh dear! I shall be late!",
          "char_id": 3,
          "sec_id": 4,
          "emotion": "anxious"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "But when the Rabbit actually took a watch out of its waistcoat-pocket, and looked at it, and then hurried on, Alice started to her feet.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 5,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "In another moment down went Alice after it.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 6,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Well! After such a fall as this, I shall think nothing of tumbling down stairs!",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 7,
          "emotion": "amused bravado"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Thought Alice to herself.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 7,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "What a curious feeling! I must be shutting up like a telescope.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 9,
          "emotion": "surprised curiosity"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Said Alice.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 9,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Soon her eye fell on a little glass box that was lying under the table.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 10,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "She opened it, and found in it a very small cake, on which the words \"Eat me\" were beautifully marked in currants.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 11,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Well, I'll eat it, and if it makes me grow larger, I can reach the key; and if it makes me grow smaller, I can creep under the door.",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 12,
          "emotion": "determined"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Said Alice.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 12,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "She ate a little bit, and said anxiously to herself.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 13,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "Which way? Which way?",
          "char_id": 2,
          "sec_id": 13,
          "emotion": "anxious"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "So she set to work, and very soon finished off the cake.",
          "char_id": 1,
          "sec_id": 14,
          "emotion": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
